# in production (see packages/ee/LICENSE). Everything NOT listed here is and
# stays open source — the AI answering/resolution core is never EE (D3).

- Multi-organization management (agencies: one instance, many clients)
- White-label rights (remove Deskbell branding from the widget)
- SSO: SAML 2.0 / OIDC (via better-auth SSO plugin)
- SCIM provisioning
- Custom roles & per-feature permissions
- Audit log (EU AI Act Art. 12-grade event logging)
- Advanced retention/redaction policies
